"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lOTAzOTc3","number":38,"title":"4.2.1","description":"","creator":{"login":"chancancode","id":55829,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55829?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode","html_url":"https://github.com/chancancode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chancancode/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":72,"state":"closed","created_at":"2014-12-15T08:25:47Z","updated_at":"2015-03-19T16:40:37Z","due_on":"2015-01-27T02:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-19T16:40:37Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2014-12-25T01:00:46Z","updated_at":"2014-12-26T20:06:35Z","closed_at":"2014-12-26T20:06:26Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I use postgres and uuid.\nLets imaging I have users which belongs to some account.\nHere are models\n\n``` ruby\nclass User < ActiveRecord::Base\n    belongs_to :account\n    validates :account, presence: true,\n                        uniqueness: {\n                            case_sensitive: false,\n                            conditions: -> { where owner: true },\n                            message: 'has already been owned'\n                         },\n                         if: -> { owner? }\n  def owner?\n    owner == true\n  end\nend\n\nclass Account < ActiveRecord::Base\n  has_many :users\nend\n```\n\nAnd here are data schemas\n\n``` ruby\ncreate_table \"users\", id: :uuid, default: \"uuid_generate_v4()\", force: true do |t|\n  t.string   \"name\"\n  t.uuid     \"account_id\",       null: false\n  t.boolean  \"owner\",           default: false\nend\n\ncreate_table \"accounts\", id: :uuid, default: \"uuid_generate_v4()\", force: true do |t|\n  t.string   \"company_name\"\nend\n```\n\nRails 4.2.0 will throw pg error when I create a new user:\n\n``` ruby\nnew_account = Account.create(company_name: \"Acme\")\nUser.create(name: \"John Doe\", account: new_account, owner: true)\n```\n\n```\nPG::UndefinedFunction: ERROR:  function lower(uuid) does not exist\nLINE 1: SELECT  1 AS one FROM \"users\" WHERE LOWER(\"users\".\"account_i...\n                                            ^\nHINT:  No function matches the given name and argument types. You might need to add explicit type casts.\n: SELECT  1 AS one FROM \"users\" WHERE LOWER(\"users\".\"account_id\") = LOWER('e61a02af-69e8-4078-929c-c62f2b9f83ed') AND \"users\".\"owner\" = 't' LIMIT 1\n```\n\nThis is how rails 4.1.x (e.g. 4.1.8) validates uniqueness\n\n``` sql\nSELECT  1 AS one FROM \"users\"  WHERE \"users\".\"account_id\" = '8a60d747-cdd0-40e1-8188-a018bb9a0ddc' AND \"users\".\"owner\" = 't' LIMIT 1\n```\n\nAnd this is how rails 4.2.0 does it:\n\n``` sql\nSELECT  1 AS one FROM \"users\" WHERE LOWER(\"users\".\"account_id\") = LOWER('8a60d747-cdd0-40e1-8188-a018bb9a0ddc') AND \"users\".\"owner\" = 't' LIMIT 1\n```\n\nI consider this is a bug in rails 4.2.0 because  http://api.rubyonrails.org/classes/ActiveRecord/Validations/ClassMethods.html#method-i-validates_uniqueness_of says:\n\n```\nConfiguration options:\n    :case_sensitive - Looks for an exact match. Ignored by non-text columns (true by default).\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"sgrif","id":1529387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjkzODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1529387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif","html_url":"https://github.com/sgrif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgrif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/18195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/18195/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}